  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In sort, it's possible to set up things, so on higer levels features will be blocked and on lower will be allowed. This is counter-intuitive in my opinion. If new ranks system presented as trust level-ups, then players expect that if one feature is allowed for one level it will be allowed for all higher trust levels, but it's not. Yes, this can be useful for some specific cases, but now it's only 6 control parametrers and it's already feels too overloaded! New users probably will be in panic if they see this! I guess instead of selecting features for specific rank it's better to select rank for specific feature. Or at least give player warning if he/she blocks features that is not blocked in lower ranks.",
